{"results":[{"url":"https://docsteach.org/document/message-of-president-abraham-lincoln-nominating-salmon-p-chase-to-be-chief-justice-of-the-supreme-court-of-the-united-states/","final_url":"https://docsteach.org/document/message-of-president-abraham-lincoln-nominating-salmon-p-chase-to-be-chief-justice-of-the-supreme-court-of-the-united-states/","title":"Message of President Abraham Lincoln nominating Salmon P. Chase to be Chief Justice of the Supreme Court of the United States - DocsTeach","description":null,"language":"en","text":"* 12/6/1864\n\nShare to Google Classroom\n\n1/1\n\nUnable to open [object Object]: Error loading image at https://i0.wp.com/docsteach.org/wp-content/uploads/documents/306311/orig\\_306311\\_5154.jpg?fit=559%2C900&ssl=1\n\nView the full document here: https://docsteach.org/document/message-of-president-abraham-lincoln-nominating-salmon-p-chase-to-be-chief-justice-of-the-supreme-court-of-the-united-states/\n\nTranscript\n\nExecutive Mansion   \nWashington D.C Dec. 6, 1864\n\nTo the Senate of the United States:\n\nI nominate Salmon P. Chase of Ohio, to be Chief Justice of the Supreme Court of the United States vice Roger B. Taney, deceased.\n\nAbraham Lincoln\n\n## Citation\n\nThis primary source comes from the Records of the U.S. Senate.\n\nNational Archives Identifier: 306311\n\nFull Citation: Message of President Abraham Lincoln nominating Salmon P. Chase to be Chief Justice of the Supreme Court of the United States; 12/6/1864; Records of the U.S. Senate, Record Group 46. [Online Version, https://docsteach.org/document/message-of-president-abraham-lincoln-nominating-salmon-p-chase-to-be-chief-justice-of-the-supreme-court-of-the-united-states/, November 6, 2026]\n\nRights:\nPublic Domain, Free of Known Copyright Restrictions.\n*Learn more on our privacy and legal page.*\n\n## Related Documents\n\nBrowse All Documents\n\n### The advance of the Gunboats up the river to New Berne, N. Carolina. Passing the Barricade\n\nCivil War and Reconstr